(505, 11, 27, '<br>Why Vocational Students Should Learn Digital Skills<br>Vocational students should develop digital skills because many workplaces now depend on technology. Employees in hotels, restaurants, offices, and retail businesses use digital systems to record transactions, communicate with customers, and manage information. <br>First, digital skills can improve work efficiency. An electronic booking system, for example, can help hotel staff manage reservations more quickly than a paper-based system. Second, digital competence can improve employment opportunities. Third, students who understand digital technology may be better prepared to adapt when workplace systems change. <br>Therefore, vocational schools should integrate digital learning into practical activities. <br> According to the text, what is one benefit of digital skills?', 1, ' They eliminate the need for teamwork. ', ' They improve efficiency and employment opportunities. ', ' They guarantee that every student will become a manager. ', ' They remove all workplace problems. ', ' They make practical training unnecessary.', 'B', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(506, 11, 28, '<br>Why Vocational Students Should Learn Digital Skills<br>Vocational students should develop digital skills because many workplaces now depend on technology. Employees in hotels, restaurants, offices, and retail businesses use digital systems to record transactions, communicate with customers, and manage information. <br>First, digital skills can improve work efficiency. An electronic booking system, for example, can help hotel staff manage reservations more quickly than a paper-based system. Second, digital competence can improve employment opportunities. Third, students who understand digital technology may be better prepared to adapt when workplace systems change. <br>Therefore, vocational schools should integrate digital learning into practical activities. <br> A hotel processes 120 reservations in six hours using a digital system. What is the average number of reservations processed per hour?', 1, ' 10 ', ' 15 ', ' 20 ', ' 25 ', ' 30', 'C', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(507, 11, 29, '<br>Why Vocational Students Should Learn Digital Skills<br>Vocational students should develop digital skills because many workplaces now depend on technology. Employees in hotels, restaurants, offices, and retail businesses use digital systems to record transactions, communicate with customers, and manage information. <br>First, digital skills can improve work efficiency. An electronic booking system, for example, can help hotel staff manage reservations more quickly than a paper-based system. Second, digital competence can improve e mployment opportunities. Third, students who understand digital technology may be better prepared to adapt when workplace systems change. <br>Therefore, vocational schools should integrate digital learning into practical activities. <br> What can be inferred from the final paragraph?', 1, ' Digital skills should be practiced in real or simulated work activities. ', ' Students only need to learn digital skills after graduation. ', ' Practical activities are less important than written examinations. ', ' Employers do not need workers with professional attitudes. ', ' Schools should stop teaching traditional vocational skills.', 'A', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(508, 11, 30, '<br>Why Vocational Students Should Learn Digital Skills<br>Vocational students should develop digital skills because many workplaces now depend on technology. Employees in hotels, restaurants, offices, and retail businesses use digital systems to record transactions, communicate with customers, and manage information. <br>First, digital skills can improve work efficiency. An electronic booking system, for example, can help hotel staff manage reservations more quickly than a paper-based system. Second, digital competence can improve employment opportunities. Third, students who understand digital technology may be better prepared to adapt when workplace systems change. <br>Therefore, vocational schools should integrate digital learning into practical activities. <br> What is the function of the final paragraph?', 1, ' To introduce a new character ', ' To describe a past event ', ' To explain a sequence of instructions ', ' To present a personal holiday experience ', ' To restate the argument and recommend an action', 'E', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(509, 11, 31, '<br>Blue Ocean Hotel Room Rates<br>Blue Ocean Hotel offers three types of rooms. A standard room costs Rp400,000 per night and accommodates two guests. A deluxe room costs Rp600,000 per night and accommodates two guests. A family room costs Rp900,000 per night and accommodates four guests. <br>All rooms include air conditioning, Wi-Fi, and breakfast. Guests who stay for three consecutive nights receive a 10% discount on the total room cost. <br> Which room is the most suitable for a family of four?', 1, ' Standard room ', ' Deluxe room ', ' Family room ', ' Any room because all accommodate four guests ', ' Standard and deluxe rooms together are always required', 'C', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(510, 11, 32, '<br>Blue Ocean Hotel Room Rates<br>Blue Ocean Hotel offers three types of rooms. A standard room costs Rp400,000 per night and accommodates two guests. A deluxe room costs Rp600,000 per night and accommodates two guests. A family room costs Rp900,000 per night and accommodates four guests. <br>All rooms include air conditioning, Wi-Fi, and breakfast. Guests who stay for three consecutive nights receive a 10% discount on the total room cost. <br> How much does a standard room cost for three nights before the discount?', 1, ' Rp800,000 ', ' Rp1,000,000 ', ' Rp1,100,000 ', ' Rp1,200,000 ', ' Rp1,400,000', 'D', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(511, 11, 33, '<br>Blue Ocean Hotel Room Rates<br>Blue Ocean Hotel offers three types of rooms. A standard room costs Rp400,000 per night and accommodates two guests. A deluxe room costs Rp600,000 per night and accommodates two guests. A family room costs Rp900,000 per night and accommodates four guests. <br>All rooms include air conditioning, Wi-Fi, and breakfast. Guests who stay for three consecutive nights receive a 10% discount on the total room cost. <br> How much does a guest pay for three nights in a standard room after the 10% discount?', 1, ' Rp1,080,000 ', ' Rp1,000,000 ', ' Rp960,000 ', ' Rp1,100,000 ', ' Rp1,200,000', 'A', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
