(569, 12, 1, '<br>Read the following text and answer the questions! <br>Antoine Griezmann is a veteran professional soccer player who was considered to be the third most expensive player in 2017. He is a French football player who was born in Macon, France, on March 21, 1991.<br>Antoine Griezmann has a slim body with a height of 176 cm and a weight of 72 kg. He has fair skin. His clean-shaven and oval face makes him look handsome, especially with his round blue eyes. His hair is straight, and the colour is light brown. He is a humble person because he once said after a match that if there is a savior, then it is the whole team as his appreciation toward all of his teammates. <br>His sign is Aries. He can play various positions on the field, such as midfielder, winger, and forward, but most of the time he plays as a forward. His back number is 7. He is an accurate finisher who can score a goal from inside and outside the penalty area. His on-field abilities are said to be comparable to those of legendary French soccer player Zinedine Zidane. He even got a new nick name, &ldquo;Grizou&rdquo; the shortening of &ldquo;Griezmann&rdquo; and &ldquo;Zizou&rdquo;. Griezmann&rsquo;s previous nickname was &ldquo;Le Petit Diable,&rdquo; which translates to &ldquo;the Little Devil,&rdquo; and was given to him because of his agility on the field, which can fool opposing players. <br> What is the first paragraph about?<br> ', 2, '', '', '', '', '', '', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
