(590, 13, 17, '<br>Read the dialogue below carefully! <br>Bima:  I think students should be allowed to use their phones during lessons. <br>Mrs. Sari:  I&#39;m afraid I don&#39;t agree. Phones can distract you from the lesson. <br>Bima:  But we can use them to look for information, Ma&#39;am. <br>Mrs. Sari:  That&#39;s a good point, Bima. Let&#39;s use them only when I ask you to. <br> What is the final decision in the dialogue?', 1, 'Phones can be used in lessons only when the teacher asks.', 'Phones are banned at school.', 'Phones can be used at any time.', 'Phones can only be used at break time.', 'Students must bring tablets instead.', 'A', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(591, 13, 18, '<br>Reading text! <br>Domestic waste is the waste that comes from daily activities at home. It includes food scraps, plastic bags, used paper, and empty cans. If we throw it carelessly, it will pollute rivers and cause floods. In addition, piles of garbage can become a place where mosquitoes breed. Fortunately, we can reduce domestic waste by bringing our own shopping bags, reusing glass jars, and recycling paper. If everyone does this, our neighborhood will be cleaner and healthier. <br> What is the text mainly about?', 1, 'The history of plastic bags', 'How mosquitoes breed', 'How to clean rivers', 'Domestic waste and how to reduce it', 'Reasons for floods', 'D', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(592, 13, 19, '<br>Reading text! <br>Domestic waste is the waste that comes from daily activities at home. It includes food scraps, plastic bags, used paper, and empty cans. If we throw it carelessly, it will pollute rivers and cause floods. In addition, piles of garbage can become a place where mosquitoes breed. Fortunately, we can reduce domestic waste by bringing our own shopping bags, reusing glass jars, and recycling paper. If everyone does this, our neighborhood will be cleaner and healthier. <br> What can be inferred from the text?', 1, 'Domestic waste is harmless.', 'Only factories produce waste.', 'Careless waste disposal can harm the environment and health.', 'Recycling is impossible at home.', 'Mosquitoes live only in rivers.', 'C', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
