(599, 13, 26, '<br><b>Bank Sampah Sejahtera</b><br>Bank Sampah Sejahtera is a place where residents can save their dry waste. Every Saturday, the staff weigh the plastic bottles, paper, and cans that residents bring. Then, the waste is sold to recyclers, and the money goes into the residents&#39; savings accounts. Many residents think the program is useful because it keeps the neighborhood clean and gives them extra income. <br>   In the sentence &#39;Bank Sampah Sejahtera is a place where residents can save their dry waste&#39;, the word &#39;where&#39; refers to ____.', 1, 'Residents', 'Waste', 'Saturday', 'A place', 'Savings ', 'D', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
